<Layout title="Articles & education | Mecosin"><section class="page-intro section-wrap"><p class="section-label"><T id="Artikel & kegiatan" en="Articles & activities" /></p><h1><T id="Baca lebih dekat." en="Read a little closer." /></h1><p><T id="Pilihan catatan kegiatan dari arsip Mecosin. Kutipan asli, konteks jelas, tanpa klaim klinis baru." en="Selected activity records from the Mecosin archive. Original excerpts and clear context, without new clinical claims." /></p></section><section class="section-wrap section-space"><div class="article-grid">{articles.map(a=><article class="article-card"><a href={`/artikel/${a.slug}/`}><img src={a.image} alt={a.title_en} width="800" height="450" /><div><p class="section-label"><T id="Arsip sumber · 5 Agustus 2024" en="Source archive · 5 August 2024" /></p><h2><T id={a.title_id} en={a.title_en} /></h2><span class="text-link"><T id="Baca kutipan ↗" en="Read excerpt ↗" /></span></div></a></article>)}</div></section><section class="section-wrap section-space prose"><p class="section-label"><T id="Edukasi membaca informasi" en="Reading product information" /></p><h2><T id="Bedakan label, cerita, dan bukti." en="Distinguish labels, stories and evidence." /></h2><p><T id="Katalog merangkum produk. Artikel sejarah mencatat kegiatan pada waktunya. Keduanya bukan penilaian kesehatan pribadi. Untuk penggunaan produk, rujuk label dan tenaga kesehatan." en="A catalog summarizes products. Historical articles record activities at a point in time. Neither is a personal health assessment. Consult the label and a healthcare professional about product use." /></p><div class="service-list"><details><summary><T id="Membaca kutipan produk" en="Reading a product excerpt" /> +</summary><p><T id="Perhatikan sumber dan apakah teks terpotong. Demo mempertahankan kutipan berbahasa Indonesia serta tautan sumber, bukan menambahkan dosis atau manfaat baru." en="Check the source and whether text is truncated. This page preserves Indonesian excerpts and source links, rather than adding dosage or benefit claims." /></p><a class="text-link" href="/produk/"><T id="Buka katalog" en="Open catalog" /></a></details><details><summary><T id="Ensiklopedia bahan herbal" en="Herbal ingredient encyclopedia" /> +</summary><p><T id="Ensiklopedia klinis lengkap belum tersedia. Diperlukan komposisi produk yang disetujui, rujukan ilmiah, riwayat penggunaan serta peninjau medis. Tidak ada manfaat klinis atau perbandingan bahan yang direka di halaman ini." en="A full clinical encyclopedia is unavailable. It needs approved product compositions, scientific references, historical context and medical reviewers. No clinical benefits or ingredient comparisons are invented on this page." /></p></details><details><summary><T id="Ruang pers & CSR" en="Press & CSR room" /> +</summary><p><T id="Catatan kegiatan sosial tersedia dalam pilihan arsip di atas. Materi pers, izin publikasi testimoni, data dampak lingkungan dan bukti pertanian etis belum tersedia." en="A community activity record is included in the archive above. Press kits, testimonial consent, environmental impact data and ethical farming evidence are unavailable." /></p></details></div><p class="notice"><T id="Artikel kesehatan lama dalam arsip tidak diterbitkan ulang sebagai panduan klinis terkini. Tanggal di kartu adalah tanggal publikasi sumber, bukan jaminan tanggal kegiatan." en="Older health articles are not republished as current clinical guidance. Card dates are source publication dates, not guaranteed event dates." /></p></section></Layout>
